    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your luck\u00a0in this mysterious roguelike deckbuilder. Defeat your boss... OR DIE!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 Steps to Success</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip over the good cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't flip over the bad cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Game Breaking Perks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid Termination!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based push-your-luck gameplay! Each turn, flip over a card and see if you get a reward or a punishment. Flip over too many punishments and you lose... how risky do you want to be?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game changing perks! Between rounds, visit Mr. Magpie's Shop and purchase from his selection of perks which change the rules of the game, and provide layered strategic goals. Build a package of perks with enough synergy to finally beat the house and leave this corporate nightmare realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. Magpie! He loves you. Why would you ever want to leave?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspirations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. Magpie is lovingly inspired by Inscryption, Severance, Balatro and Party House.</p>",
